### Feature Teacher — DELETE físico / DELETE lógico
### Leyenda: SIN AUTH (sin middleware JWT / sin autenticación)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@id = 1

# @name deleteTeacherPhysical
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/docentes/{{id}}

###

# @name deleteTeacherLogical
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/docentes/{{id}}/deactivate
